Subject: [PATCH 19/21] ttf: read vertical metrics

vhea and vmtx were not read, so a font with vertical metrics (most CJK fonts) compiled
without them. vhea's ascender, descender and line gap become the master's vhea metrics;
each glyph's vmtx advance is its layer's vertical advance, and the top of its bounding box
plus its top side bearing its vertical origin.

Assisted by an AI agent (Claude Opus 5.5)
